 "category_zh": "历史遗址",
 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "芒砀山景区是集山水观光、文化观赏、生态休闲于一体的综合性旅游景区，面积为14平方公里，主要有世界上规模最大的地下西汉梁王陵墓群——汉梁王陵景区、刘邦斩蛇处、大汉雄风景区、芒砀山地质公园、陈胜园景区、夫子山景区、僖山景区等景点。",
 "intro_en": "The Mangdang Mountain Scenic Area is a comprehensive tourist attraction integrating landscape sightseeing, cultural appreciation, and ecological leisure. It covers an area of ​​14 square kilometers. It mainly includes the world's largest underground tombs of the Liang Dynasty Kings of the Western Han Dynasty - Han Liang Wang Tomb Scenic Area, Liu Bang's Snake Killing Area, Dahanxiong Scenic Area, Mangdang Mountain Geopark, Chen Shengyuan Scenic Area, Confucius Mountain Scenic Area, Xishan Scenic Area and other attractions.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
